1
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:42,000
O Lord, protect for us His Majesty the Sultan

2
00:00:42,600 --> 00:00:48,800
and the people in our land

3
00:00:48,800 --> 00:00:55,000
with honor and peace.

4
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:59,000
May he live long,and be victorious,

5
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:01,000
A leader , honored and glorious.

6
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:10,400
welling to protect him by our soles.

7
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:30,400
O Oman (Ya‘Uman) , since the time of the Prophet

8
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:37,400
We are a dedicated people amongst the noblest Arabs.

9
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:40,000
So raise to the sky

10
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:43,000
And fill yours and our universe with light,

11
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:52,800
And said, be happy and live with all bliss.